  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  timeFromStartup: 0
--- !u!114 &114924831428766102
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1742309939933060}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 56ec6c25ac577afeb80be7acb7b0702d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorials:
  - logs:
    - content_en: 'Welcome to SCP: Secret Laboratory! I''m one of the voice actors
        for the game.

        Let me introduce you to basic gameplay rules.

        Try
        to find and check toilets in order to find a potential keycard.

'
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7f3cb3cc420a97b4f991062d13294e1b, type: 3}
      duration_en: 12
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 1
      alias: 
    - content_en: '<color=#00FF58>Use <b>W, A, S & D</b> in order to go to the <b>toilets</b>

        Use
        <b>E</b> to <b>interact</b> with doors and items.</color>'
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: 10000
      jumpforward: 0
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: Great, now take it.
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 826c88fb697df9f45b5a90d890dd9bc3, type: 3}
      duration_en: 2
      jumpforward: 0
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: 'Keycards are one of the most basic elements of the game, allowing
        entrance to locked areas.

        Check the nearby doors and try to open
        them with your card.'
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 733fec177198a364aa214bf87682a7e7, type: 3}
      duration_en: 8
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: scientist
    - content_en: '<color=#00FF58>Use <b>TAB</b> to open inventory.

        <b>Left
        mouse button</b> to select item

        and <b>right</b> to drop it.'
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: 10000
      jumpforward: 0
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: If you really want to escape - I'd suggest finding a better card.
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f0936d7630c97074fbb6c127fa508bff, type: 3}
      duration_en: 4
      jumpforward: 0
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: better
    - content_en: Every card has its own access levels. You can compare cards by
        hovering your mouse cursor over each one in your inventory.
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 08fbbcb7f4602834c8c3551a3dae13eb, type: 3}
      duration_en: 7
      jumpforward: 0
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: manager
    - content_en: Congratulations! You just passed the first part of the tutorial!
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7de72e08e3e11db43b9b1392835a9380, type: 3}
      duration_en: 4
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 1
      alias: finish
    - content_en: 
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: -100
      jumpforward: 0
      stopPlayer: 1
      alias: 
  - logs:
    - content_en: 'Ok, let''s get started...

        Learning the basics skills
        of shooting definitely makes gameplay... <i>easier</i>.

        Pick Up
        the pistol that just landed on the board.'
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 597a263293c586a4cb706838da4e6b2e, type: 3}
      duration_en: 11
      jumpforward: 0
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: Tutorial2_Curtain
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: -200
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: pistoltake
    - content_en: So, you just picked up the shittiest weapon in the game. Get used
        to it, because it'll get you out of some pretty hairy situations. Oh, and
        it's good to have some ammunition. It is difficult to find it in the game,
        so shoot as efficiently as you can.
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 08b89374fb79e134e95aa4600fe652d0, type: 3}
      duration_en: 14
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: Tutorial2_GiveAmmo
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: -200
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: Remember, that headshots will take down your opponent faster. If
        you run out of ammo in this test, I'll give you more!
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bd710d5cd48c02c4ba32fd6d14a434fc, type: 3}
      duration_en: 6.5
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: '<color=#00FF58>Use <b>R</b> to reload,

        <b>right mouse
        button</b> to zoom

        and <b>left</b> to shoot.</color>'
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: 10000
      jumpforward: 0
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: keybinding
    - content_en: Tutorial2_Result
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: -200
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: Impressive, you dispatched them all with a single magazine!
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 63db9ef86737a7f46a10616cda0f0c10, type: 3}
      duration_en: 4
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: result_good
    - content_en: Tutorial2_Jumpin
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: -200
      jumpforward: 0
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: Hey, you're pretty good at shooting!
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 27761dd62c2dff44887af19825ef39d8, type: 3}
      duration_en: 2
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: result_ok
    - content_en: Tutorial2_Jumpin
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: -200
      jumpforward: 0
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: I really hoped for a bigger display of skill, such a shame.
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5627a87f6c117ab4ebb7ff12d77515f0, type: 3}
      duration_en: 6
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: result_bad
    - content_en: Tutorial2_GiveNTFRifle
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: -200
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: epsilon
    - content_en: 'Ok, I hope you hate this weapon as much as I do, let''s put the
        toys a side, and pick up a real weapon. This one has an night vision sight
        that makes shooting easier.

        You should know, that zooming or aiming
        any weapon guarantees accuracy and a greater reduction of recoil.'
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4b40eb4bdb543b245934e68ad73ae1ac, type: 3}
      duration_en: 17
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: Tutorial2_Preset
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: -200
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: Tutorial2_Curtain
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: -200
      jumpforward: 0
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: Tutorial2_Curtain
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: -200
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: secondkill
    - content_en: 'I can see you''ve already mastered the basics! I have prepared
        a challenge for you.

        You have 20 seconds to kill as many opponents
        as you can.

        Let''s get started!'
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: df54cee00170df9449bbd37fe06070d7, type: 3}
      duration_en: 11
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: Ready? 3, 2, 1... GO
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0ace22fb9958337459be65adcde6fdd7, type: 3}
      duration_en: 5
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: Tutorial2_Preset
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: -200
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: Tutorial2_Curtain
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: -200
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: 
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b0c221902ed5eb140b2e63270c37bb78, type: 3}
      duration_en: 20
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: Tutorial2_ResultText
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: -200
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: Tutorial2_Curtain
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: -200
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: Time's up!
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b621badbdb57bf45b9d2989e95dcc16, type: 3}
      duration_en: 1
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: 'Remember that you can always re-visit this tutorial in the future

        if
        you want to brush up on your skills!

        See you later!'
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 263e5d5c6623f534683306005e42a2fa, type: 3}
      duration_en: 8
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: 
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: -100
      jumpforward: 0
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: Tutorial2_MoreAmmo
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: -200
      jumpforward: 0
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: ammoplz
  - logs:
    - content_en: Here we go! There is no round in which you won't have to use SCP-914.
        It's a special machine that allows you to change the access level of your
        keycards. Please enter the containment chamber.
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0b865401af57b8e4387b3d7d37d6cf54, type: 3}
      duration_en: 12
      jumpforward: 0
      stopPlayer: 1
      alias: 
    - content_en: Look at the panel with the knob. It can be turned into 5 different
        positions.
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eb81cce2d2256b447a94e2951034ff8c, type: 3}
      duration_en: 6
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: '1:1 - changes the type of a keycard. For instance:

        the
        Scientist keycard to a Guard keycard;

        or an MTF commander keycard
        to a Containment engineer keycard'
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d63ac777447587046b7eed5d182a5bfd, type: 3}
      duration_en: 13.5
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: Fine - increases the level of the card, and Coarse - decreases
        it.
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6b2eb363eee91a8439bfd8eb1a0f91a0, type: 3}
      duration_en: 6
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: Very fine and Rough are equivalents of Fine and Coarse. They're
        faster, but more risky.
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 100edb916e7c278498fbaeda1f6a4a22, type: 3}
      duration_en: 7
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: Tutorial3_GiveKeycard
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: -200
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: 'I just threw you a card somewhere on the floor.

        Pick
        it up and try to upgrade it to the highest level - the O5 Keycard.'
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fb65c3977149ac846845fa88a8f14f83, type: 3}
      duration_en: 8
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: <color=#00FF58>Set the knob to <b>Fine, Very fine or 1:1</b> to
        upgrade the keycard.
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: 10
      jumpforward: 0
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: What have you done? I didn't expect this... there's nothing interesting,
        go back to SCP-914!
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b1523b6addd9ca74da0d3ce6d787dd0d, type: 3}
      duration_en: 8
      jumpforward: 0
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: armory
    - content_en: You did something wrong and you burned it. No problem, take another
        one.
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0a777e5e43a759044abaf38ddf1bbf46, type: 3}
      duration_en: 6
      jumpforward: 0
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: bc1
    - content_en: Oh, you did it again! Come on! Take the next one.
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 081e9490cfdbe754e969698e4dadffb2, type: 3}
      duration_en: 7
      jumpforward: 0
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: bc2
    - content_en: 'You know what? Maybe I will give you 5 keycards for once?

        Remember,
        we want O5-level keycard, no ash.'
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1a6696af88692bf439eca1b73f2748c6, type: 3}
      duration_en: 9.5
      jumpforward: 0
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: bc3
    - content_en: Ehh, you are doing it on purpose. Do you think this is funny? You
        know what I can do, and you can't prevent? Quitting the game! Yeah! Come
        back later when you a little smarter!
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ed31dfb8b3281c542a388fbcfbe72fa7, type: 3}
      duration_en: 14
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: bc4
    - content_en: Tutorial3_Quit
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: -200
      jumpforward: 0
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
    - content_en: Well done! With this card can enter anywhere! I see that you understand
        what SCP-914 is. I hope you will be able to use the acquired skills in normal
        gameplay. Good luck!
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1a917c2ecb7c31e418de4440d84c4dec, type: 3}
      duration_en: 14
      jumpforward: 1
      stopPlayer: 1
      alias: complete
    - content_en: 
      clip_en: {fileID: 0}
      duration_en: -100
      jumpforward: 0
      stopPlayer: 0
      alias: 
  - logs:
    - content_en: Here we go! There is no round in which you won't have to use SCP-914.
        It's a special machine that allows you to change the access level of your
        keycards. Please enter the containment chamber.
      clip_en: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0b865401af57b8e4387b3d7d37d6cf54, type: 3}
      duration_en: 12
      jumpforward: 0
      stopPlayer: 1
      alias: 
